<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5510/5520.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5510/5520.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5510/5520 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Wednesday will be 5515.</p>
<p>On Monday the bid/offer rates were 5508/5518, with the official dollar rate 5513 from Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5423/6023 after 5421/6021.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
